---
import DashiconsExternal from '~icons/dashicons/external';
---

<div class='mt-12 border-t border-gray-200 pt-2'>
    <h3 class='text-base font-semibold text-main my-3 mt-4'>Want to integrate your resource?</h3>
    <p class='text-gray-700'>
        We welcome integrations with external resources. Our API provides programmatic access to sequence data and
        metadata. If you wish to add your resource to the list, please send us a request through GitHub.
    </p>
    <div class='mt-4 flex items-center gap-6'>
        <a
            href='https://github.com/pathoplexus/pathoplexus/issues'
            class='inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-primary-600/60 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-primary-700 no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-primary-50 hover:no-underline!'
        >
            Submit request
            <DashiconsExternal className='ml-1' />
        </a>
        <a href='/api-documentation' class='text-sm text-primary-700 underline hover:text-primary-800'>
            View API documentation
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
